  "title": "Colossians 3",
  "display_title": "Colossians 3",
  "translation": "King James Version",
  "translationCode": "KJV",
  "bookId": "colossians",
  "book": "Colossians",
  "bookName": "Colossians",
  "bookOrder": 51,
  "testament": "new",
  "chapter": 3,
  "sortOrder": 51003,
  "verseCount": 25,
  "aliases": [
    "Col",
    "Co"
  ],
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "verse-001",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 1,
      "verseId": "kjv:colossians:3:1",
      "numberLabel": "1",
      "text": "If ye then be risen with Christ, seek those things which are above, where Christ sitteth on the right hand of God.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Colossians 3:1",
        "verseKey": "kjv:colossians:3:1"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-002",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 2,
      "verseId": "kjv:colossians:3:2",
      "numberLabel": "2",
      "text": "Set your affection on things above, not on things on the earth.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Colossians 3:2",
        "verseKey": "kjv:colossians:3:2"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-003",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 3,
      "verseId": "kjv:colossians:3:3",
      "numberLabel": "3",
      "text": "For ye are dead, and your life is hid with Christ in God.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Colossians 3:3",
        "verseKey": "kjv:colossians:3:3"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-004",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 4,
      "verseId": "kjv:colossians:3:4",
      "numberLabel": "4",
      "text": "When Christ, who is our life, shall appear, then shall ye also appear with him in glory.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Colossians 3:4",
        "verseKey": "kjv:colossians:3:4"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-005",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 5,
      "verseId": "kjv:colossians:3:5",
      "numberLabel": "5",
      "text": "Mortify therefore your members which are upon the earth; fornication, uncleanness, inordinate affection, evil concupiscence, and covetousness, which is idolatry:",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Colossians 3:5",
        "verseKey": "kjv:colossians:3:5"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-006",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 6,
      "verseId": "kjv:colossians:3:6",
      "numberLabel": "6",
      "text": "For which things’ sake the wrath of God cometh on the children of disobedience:",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Colossians 3:6",
        "verseKey": "kjv:colossians:3:6"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-007",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 7,
      "verseId": "kjv:colossians:3:7",
      "numberLabel": "7",
      "text": "In the which ye also walked some time, when ye lived in them.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Colossians 3:7",
        "verseKey": "kjv:colossians:3:7"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-008",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 8,
      "verseId": "kjv:colossians:3:8",
      "numberLabel": "8",
      "text": "But now ye also put off all these; anger, wrath, malice, blasphemy, filthy communication out of your mouth.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Colossians 3:8",
        "verseKey": "kjv:colossians:3:8"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-009",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 9,
      "verseId": "kjv:colossians:3:9",
      "numberLabel": "9",
      "text": "Lie not one to another, seeing that ye have put off the old man with his deeds;",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Colossians 3:9",
        "verseKey": "kjv:colossians:3:9"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-010",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 10,
      "verseId": "kjv:colossians:3:10",
      "numberLabel": "10",
      "text": "And have put on the new man, which is renewed in knowledge after the image of him that created him:",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Colossians 3:10",
        "verseKey": "kjv:colossians:3:10"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-011",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 11,
      "verseId": "kjv:colossians:3:11",
      "numberLabel": "11",
      "text": "Where there is neither Greek nor Jew, circumcision nor uncircumcision, Barbarian, Scythian, bond nor free: but Christ is all, and in all.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Colossians 3:11",
        "verseKey": "kjv:colossians:3:11"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-012",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 12,
      "verseId": "kjv:colossians:3:12",
      "numberLabel": "12",
      "text": "Put on therefore, as the elect of God, holy and beloved, bowels of mercies, kindness, humbleness of mind, meekness, longsuffering;",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Colossians 3:12",
        "verseKey": "kjv:colossians:3:12"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-013",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 13,
      "verseId": "kjv:colossians:3:13",
      "numberLabel": "13",
      "text": "Forbearing one another, and forgiving one another, if any man have a quarrel against any: even as Christ forgave you, so also do ye.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Colossians 3:13",
        "verseKey": "kjv:colossians:3:13"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-014",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 14,
      "verseId": "kjv:colossians:3:14",
      "numberLabel": "14",
      "text": "And above all these things put on charity, which is the bond of perfectness.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Colossians 3:14",
        "verseKey": "kjv:colossians:3:14"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-015",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 15,
      "verseId": "kjv:colossians:3:15",
      "numberLabel": "15",
      "text": "And let the peace of God rule in your hearts, to the which also ye are called in one body; and be ye thankful.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Colossians 3:15",
        "verseKey": "kjv:colossians:3:15"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-016",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 16,
      "verseId": "kjv:colossians:3:16",
      "numberLabel": "16",
      "text": "Let the word of Christ dwell in you richly in all wisdom; teaching and admonishing one another in psalms and hymns and spiritual songs, singing with grace in your hearts to the Lord.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Colossians 3:16",
        "verseKey": "kjv:colossians:3:16"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-017",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 17,
      "verseId": "kjv:colossians:3:17",
      "numberLabel": "17",
      "text": "And whatsoever ye do in word or deed, do all in the name of the Lord Jesus, giving thanks to God and the Father by him.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Colossians 3:17",
        "verseKey": "kjv:colossians:3:17"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-018",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 18,
      "verseId": "kjv:colossians:3:18",
      "numberLabel": "18",
      "text": "Wives, submit yourselves unto your own husbands, as it is fit in the Lord.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Colossians 3:18",
        "verseKey": "kjv:colossians:3:18"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-019",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 19,
      "verseId": "kjv:colossians:3:19",
      "numberLabel": "19",
      "text": "Husbands, love your wives, and be not bitter against them.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Colossians 3:19",
        "verseKey": "kjv:colossians:3:19"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-020",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 20,
      "verseId": "kjv:colossians:3:20",
      "numberLabel": "20",
      "text": "Children, obey your parents in all things: for this is well pleasing unto the Lord.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Colossians 3:20",
        "verseKey": "kjv:colossians:3:20"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-021",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 21,
      "verseId": "kjv:colossians:3:21",
      "numberLabel": "21",
      "text": "Fathers, provoke not your children to anger, lest they be discouraged.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Colossians 3:21",
        "verseKey": "kjv:colossians:3:21"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-022",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 22,
      "verseId": "kjv:colossians:3:22",
      "numberLabel": "22",
      "text": "Servants, obey in all things your masters according to the flesh; not with eyeservice, as menpleasers; but in singleness of heart, fearing God:",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Colossians 3:22",
        "verseKey": "kjv:colossians:3:22"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-023",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 23,
      "verseId": "kjv:colossians:3:23",
      "numberLabel": "23",
      "text": "And whatsoever ye do, do it heartily, as to the Lord, and not unto men;",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Colossians 3:23",
        "verseKey": "kjv:colossians:3:23"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-024",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 24,
      "verseId": "kjv:colossians:3:24",
      "numberLabel": "24",
      "text": "Knowing that of the Lord ye shall receive the reward of the inheritance: for ye serve the Lord Christ.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Colossians 3:24",
        "verseKey": "kjv:colossians:3:24"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-025",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 25,
      "verseId": "kjv:colossians:3:25",
      "numberLabel": "25",
      "text": "But he that doeth wrong shall receive for the wrong which he hath done: and there is no respect of persons.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Colossians 3:25",
        "verseKey": "kjv:colossians:3:25"
      }
    }
  ],
